            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not that we can verify. Redcon1's MRE Lite product page makes no third-party, banned-substance or heavy-metal testing claim, and no Redcon1 products appeared in the NSF Certified for Sport listing when we checked in November 2026. Some aggregator websites claim Informed Sport certification, but Redcon1 does not state it. Drug-tested athletes should choose a product listed in a certifier's database."
