        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does MRE Lite contain whey or dairy?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "MRE Lite contains no whey protein, per Redcon1, and is labeled lactose free. It does contain dairy: retail labels list milk powder and an MCT oil powder made with nonfat dry milk, and the allergen statement says it contains milk, egg, fish and coconut. People with a milk allergy should avoid it and choose an egg white or beef isolate."
